# Cargo build artefacts per-package
*/native/target/

# loft package output tarballs (per-package, regenerated on `loft package`)
*.tar.gz

# test-runner logs + generated native FFI bridge (regenerated on `loft test`/`--native`)
*/tests/.loft/
*/native-auto/

# per-package loft build output.  `zttext` builds an `--html` artifact from `src/`
# (parity.sh), and that directory holds a multi-megabyte wasm cache beside the page —
# regenerated by the build, so it is never committed.
*/src/.loft/

# macOS Finder cruft
.DS_Store

# per-package loft dependency lock (regenerated)
*/loft.lock
